---
const MAPS_URL = "https://maps.app.goo.gl/fhUuFZzXsbpZfCoe8";
---

<section class="relative w-full flex items-center justify-center py-12 px-5">
  <div
    class="relative w-full max-w-xs mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center rounded-2xl shadow-2xl px-7 py-8"
    style="background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.96);"
  >
    <!-- Icono bus -->
    <div
      class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full"
      style="width: 4rem; height: 4rem; background-color: #f7f0e8;"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="#b8956a"
        stroke-width="1.5"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        class="w-8 h-8"
      >
        <rect x="3" y="6" width="18" height="12" rx="2"></rect>
        <path
          d="M8 6v6m8-6v6M3 10h18M5 18v2a1 1 0 001 1h1a1 1 0 001-1v-2m8 0v2a1 1 0 001 1h1a1 1 0 001-1v-2"
        ></path>
        <circle cx="7.5" cy="18" r="1" fill="#b8956a" stroke="none"></circle>
        <circle cx="16.5" cy="18" r="1" fill="#b8956a" stroke="none"></circle>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <!-- Título -->
    <h2
      class="font-crimson uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-3"
      style="font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 5vw, 1.4rem); font-weight: 700; color: #b8956a;"
    >
      ¡Los buscamos!
    </h2>

    <!-- Línea -->
    <div class="w-full mb-4" style="height: 1px; background-color: #e0d5c5;">
    </div>

    <!-- Texto amable -->
    <p
      class="font-raleway mb-4"
      style="font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 4vw, 1rem); font-weight: 300; color: #666; line-height: 1.8;"
    >
      Para que disfrutes sin preocuparte del traslado, contaremos con un
      <span style="color: #b8956a; font-weight: 400;">bus de cortesía</span>
      que saldrá a las
    </p>

    <!-- Hora destacada -->
    <p
      class="font-crimson font-bold mb-1"
      style="font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 13vw, 4rem); color: #b8956a; line-height: 1;"
    >
      12:30
    </p>
    <p
      class="font-raleway mb-4"
      style="font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 3.5vw, 0.95rem); color: #aaa; font-weight: 300; letter-spacing:0.1em;"
    >
      hs · sábado 22 de agosto
    </p>

    <!-- Línea -->
    <div class="w-full mb-4" style="height: 1px; background-color: #e0d5c5;">
    </div>

    <!-- Plaza -->
    <p
      class="font-raleway mb-1"
      style="font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 3vw, 0.8rem); color: #aaa; font-weight:300; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.2em;"
    >
      Punto de salida
    </p>
    <p
      class="font-crimson mb-5"
      style="font-size: clamp(1rem, 4.5vw, 1.25rem); font-weight: 700; color: #2a2a2a; line-height:1.3;"
    >
      Plaza Alexander<br />von Humboldt
    </p>

    <!-- Botón -->
    <a
      href={MAPS_URL}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full py-3 px-6 font-raleway transition-all hover:opacity-85 active:scale-95"
      style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c9a97a, #b8956a); color: #fff; font-size: clamp(0.85rem, 4vw, 1rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(184,149,106,0.4);"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        class="w-4 h-4"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      >
        <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13S3 17 3 10a9 9 0 1118 0z"></path>
        <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
      </svg>
      Ver punto de salida
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
